WEBVTT

00:01.600 --> 00:08.498
[♪ three pieces, shuffled]

00:08.533 --> 00:11.396
Three pieces of one recording, shuffled.

00:11.396 --> 00:12.899
Which order is right?

00:14.333 --> 00:15.680
Two, one, three.

00:15.933 --> 00:21.811
[♪ the original order]

00:21.867 --> 00:28.530
Before our training, Qwen2.5-Omni solves
puzzles like this just 27 percent of the time.

00:28.530 --> 00:30.597
After Audio-R1, 60 percent.

00:31.666 --> 00:34.091
Audio-R1 trains on puzzles like this.

00:34.091 --> 00:38.744
We build them from raw audio, so the
answers are known by construction:

00:38.744 --> 00:39.793
no human labels.

00:40.066 --> 00:43.854
The model reasons, then answers,
and a simple rule checks it.

00:43.854 --> 00:45.407
That check is the reward.

00:45.666 --> 00:51.192
We sample eight answers per puzzle, and GRPO
pushes the model toward the ones that scored.

00:52.265 --> 00:53.640
Three kinds of puzzle.

00:53.640 --> 00:55.702
You just tried Temporal Ordering.

00:55.999 --> 00:57.188
Region Inpainting:

00:57.188 --> 00:59.435
which of four clips fills the gap?

00:59.732 --> 01:05.630
[♪ the masked clip]

01:05.665 --> 01:07.662
Clip C, the missing middle.

01:07.932 --> 01:08.935
Identity Detection:

01:08.935 --> 01:11.787
which candidates are the same
recording as the anchor?

01:12.864 --> 01:18.205
On Qwen2.5-Omni, each puzzle helps on its
own, and all three together work best.

01:18.464 --> 01:20.380
Same puzzles, different training:

01:20.380 --> 01:23.224
supervised fine-tuning
learns them about as well,

01:23.224 --> 01:25.953
but transfers only modestly to real benchmarks.

01:25.953 --> 01:28.449
Reinforcement learning transfers much more.

01:28.731 --> 01:33.162
A judge model also scores its reasoning
a bit higher than both, for completeness,

01:33.162 --> 01:35.186
coherence and grounding in the audio.

01:36.263 --> 01:37.146
Try one more.

01:37.397 --> 01:44.387
[♪ three pieces, shuffled]

01:44.397 --> 01:46.487
Three, two, one.

01:47.530 --> 01:52.406
On four audio-language models, Audio-R1
improved every benchmark we tested.

01:52.663 --> 01:57.261
With Qwen3-Omni, it reaches the highest
scores of all the models we compared.

01:57.530 --> 01:59.202
Hear more on our project page.
